------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. PRECEDENT DENSITY: what regime do post_hiking queries actually
   retrieve their evidence from? (the proposal's literal question)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Across 27 post_hiking queries, on average 59% of each query's top-5 retrieved precedents are ALSO post_hiking-regime events; the rest are drawn from earlier regimes (pre_zlb/zlb) because post_hiking is a brand-new regime with little same-regime history yet.

